Package: libreprint
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: LibrePrint contributors <147175691+juujbyg@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), cups, cups-client
Recommends: ipp-usb, avahi-daemon, avahi-utils, libnss-mdns, printer-driver-hpcups, hplip, sane-utils, sane-airscan, libsane-hpaio, cups-ipp-utils, python3-gi, gir1.2-adw-1, python3-cairo
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/@OWNER@/libreprint
Description: Set up any HP printer or MFP with one command
 libreprint detects HP printers and multifunction devices (USB or network), picks
 the right method (driverless IPP Everywhere, HPLIP, or HPLIP with the HP
 plugin), creates the CUPS queue, configures scanning and diagnoses common
 problems with "libreprint doctor".
 .
 It builds on CUPS, IPP Everywhere, ipp-usb, HPLIP and SANE. It is not a new
 driver and is not affiliated with HP Inc.
